1
00:00:04,458 --> 00:00:06,764
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:06,764 --> 00:00:09,275
Friends, Not Underlings!

3
00:00:10,375 --> 00:00:13,705
{Jun} Hey, everyone! Jun here!

4
00:00:13,705 --> 00:00:17,434
{Jun} Let's watch another episode of Metal Cardbot together!

5
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:21,086
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

6
00:00:21,086 --> 00:00:23,464
Shadow X, setup!

7
00:00:24,054 --> 00:00:28,195
{Shadow X} Hey, everyone! It's me again, Shadow X!

8
00:00:28,195 --> 00:00:31,710
{Shadow X} Two episodes in a row? Isn't this exciting~!

9
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:33,762
{Jun} It's nice to see you again, Shadow X!

10
00:00:33,762 --> 00:00:36,966
{Jun} Today, let's watch the story of how I

11
00:00:36,966 --> 00:00:40,170
{Jun} managed to beat Shadow X with a secret weapon!

12
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:43,326
{Jun} Shall we get started?

13
00:00:43,874 --> 00:00:47,298
Don't worry. I'll think of a plan starting now.

14
00:00:47,298 --> 00:00:49,302
What are you two talking about?

15
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:50,771
Vera?

16
00:00:51,082 --> 00:00:53,213
It's none of your business.

17
00:00:53,213 --> 00:00:54,981
Oh, really?

18
00:00:55,241 --> 00:00:57,055
I think it is.

19
00:01:00,087 --> 00:01:01,258
Aah!

20
00:01:01,530 --> 00:01:02,606
Heheh.

21
00:01:02,606 --> 00:01:04,158
Here's the thing.

22
00:01:04,158 --> 00:01:07,012
We were filming a dance video by the docks of Mowtown yesterday.

23
00:01:07,012 --> 00:01:11,503
When robots came out of nowhere and started fighting, I quickly got out my camera.

24
00:01:11,608 --> 00:01:14,581
{Shadow X} Ve-Vera is so scary, Jun!

25
00:01:14,581 --> 00:01:17,737
{Shadow X} Can't we just reveal the identity of Metal Cardbots to her?

26
00:01:17,737 --> 00:01:20,442
{Jun} No way, Shadow X!

27
00:01:20,442 --> 00:01:24,344
{Jun} It'll be dangerous for you if your identity is revealed!

28
00:01:24,344 --> 00:01:27,865
{Shadow X} I think Vera is scarier than Blue Cop...

29
00:01:27,865 --> 00:01:29,481
{Jun} That's true...

30
00:01:29,481 --> 00:01:35,192
{Jun} I'll have to be more careful next time, so Vera doesn't catch me!

31
00:01:35,192 --> 00:01:37,040
Hey! Get back here!

32
00:01:44,578 --> 00:01:46,615
Good day, everyone.

33
00:01:46,615 --> 00:01:51,301
I would like to address the rumors going around regarding a giant robot.

34
00:01:51,301 --> 00:01:52,804
Giant robot?

35
00:01:52,804 --> 00:01:54,003
Yes!

36
00:01:54,003 --> 00:01:55,914
There have been reported sightings of robots in

37
00:01:55,914 --> 00:02:00,313
concrete channels, under highways, and flying above the city,

38
00:02:00,414 --> 00:02:03,933
{Shadow X} Hahaha! What's with that getup, Jun?

39
00:02:03,933 --> 00:02:05,754
{Shadow X} Are you playing detective?

40
00:02:05,754 --> 00:02:10,104
{Jun} You need to get in character to get people's attention!

41
00:02:10,104 --> 00:02:13,609
{Shadow X} Your voice is different than usual! It's weird! Heheh!

42
00:02:13,609 --> 00:02:17,332
{Jun} Doesn't my acting suit the character I'm playing?

43
00:02:17,332 --> 00:02:20,310
{Shadow X} But... Who wouldn't be able to tell it’s you, Jun?

44
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:26,429
{Jun} Shadow X! In times like this, you just need to suspend disbelief.

45
00:02:26,429 --> 00:02:30,248
That dweeb is trying to sabotage the video we took of the robots!

46
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:34,973
So tell me, what do we do next?

47
00:02:34,973 --> 00:02:36,567
I'll start thinking about that now.

48
00:02:37,268 --> 00:02:39,188
Not this again!

49
00:02:39,188 --> 00:02:41,341
Jun! It's all set up.

50
00:02:43,984 --> 00:02:45,682
Output 120%!

51
00:02:45,682 --> 00:02:47,228
I'm not backing down yet!

52
00:02:47,228 --> 00:02:48,841
Keep it up, Mega Trucker!

53
00:02:48,841 --> 00:02:51,760
This is sure to work against Shadow X!

54
00:02:59,656 --> 00:03:00,860
Shadow X!

55
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:05,000
So you guys are training? Should've let me know! I would have helped you!

56
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,775
Augh, this is a rental!

57
00:03:06,775 --> 00:03:10,566
{Shadow X} By the way, Jun... what was Edo doing lying on the ground like that?

58
00:03:10,566 --> 00:03:14,584
{Jun} That was the equipment that Uncle Ed borrowed...

59
00:03:14,584 --> 00:03:17,817
{Shadow X} Ah! Is he picking up coins that fell on the ground?

60
00:03:17,817 --> 00:03:20,747
{Jun} What? No!

61
00:03:20,747 --> 00:03:24,235
{Jun} He's sad because he can't return the equipment he borrowed!

62
00:03:24,235 --> 00:03:27,271
{Shadow X} Hmm, something he borrowed from someone else...

63
00:03:27,271 --> 00:03:29,007
{Shadow X} He should've been more careful with it!

64
00:03:29,007 --> 00:03:35,174
{Jun} Huh?! Shadow X! You're the one who did that!

65
00:03:35,473 --> 00:03:37,966
Woah! Not bad!

66
00:03:37,966 --> 00:03:39,947
Now I'll show you something fun!

67
00:03:39,947 --> 00:03:42,280
Heli-Tornado!

68
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:55,182
Jun! Are you alright?

69
00:03:55,182 --> 00:03:56,987
I'm okay, don't worry!

70
00:03:56,987 --> 00:04:00,076
Just hang in there. Let's get out of here for now.

71
00:04:00,076 --> 00:04:02,751
Trust me on this! Friends believe in each other.

72
00:04:07,049 --> 00:04:08,618
Friends...

73
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:11,199
He can't keep that up for long!

74
00:04:13,878 --> 00:04:15,485
His system is overloaded!

75
00:04:15,485 --> 00:04:17,322
Get him now, Blue Cop!

76
00:04:20,656 --> 00:04:22,577
Megabolt Punch!

77
00:04:28,372 --> 00:04:30,293
Megabolt...

78
00:04:30,293 --> 00:04:31,428
Punch!

79
00:04:31,428 --> 00:04:33,367
Aaaaah!

80
00:04:40,362 --> 00:04:46,562
{Shadow X} Jun, the power of a friend is amazing, isn't it? Enough to beat my Heli-Tornado!

81
00:04:46,562 --> 00:04:49,952
{Jun} That's what we call 'friendship'.

82
00:04:49,952 --> 00:04:54,574
{Shadow X} So now that I'm friends with Jun, can I become stronger too?

83
00:04:54,574 --> 00:04:56,247
{Jun} Of course!

84
00:04:56,247 --> 00:05:00,718
{Jun} Let's get stronger and seal the Metal Cardbots together!

85
00:05:00,718 --> 00:05:02,059
{Shadow X} Alright!

86
00:05:02,059 --> 00:05:06,999
{Shadow X} Let's show them the power of friendship!

87
00:05:10,598 --> 00:05:13,196
Not an underling. But a friend.

88
00:05:14,192 --> 00:05:15,343
Sealing complete!

89
00:05:15,343 --> 00:05:16,720
Good job.

90
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:19,276
{Jun} How was that, everyone?

91
00:05:19,276 --> 00:05:23,480
{Jun} I finally succeeded in sealing Shadow X!

92
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:28,119
{Jun} I hope you look forward to the next "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!

